Supplier terms, as agreed on the phone with Tai Han Alloy, 9 January 2026 (Mira)

- Frames and forks for Meridian 3: 310 and 95 euros a piece at 500 units a year.
- Lead time 14 weeks from purchase order to Kiel, sea freight, one container a quarter.
- Tooling for the hydroformed top tube is ours; they store it and may not use it for others.
- Payment 30 percent on order, 70 percent on bill of lading.
- If the die needs a third trial, the trial is on them.

Not yet in writing. Anke wants it in the frame contract before the April order.
